# LINE ENDINGS ARE LF, EVERYWHERE, FOR EVERYBODY.
#
# This repository lives on the WSL filesystem and is worked on from both sides
# of it. Git for Windows defaults to core.autocrlf=true, which rewrites text
# files with CRLF on checkout, and bash reads a carriage return as part of the
# interpreter name ("bash\r: No such file or directory"). Committed here, this
# protects every clone on every platform, which a setting on one machine cannot.

* text=auto eol=lf

*.sh text eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
*.ogg binary
*.so binary
